meta {
  name: Create Unified Payment
  type: http
  seq: 16
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/finance/payment-console/unified-payment
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "applicationGuid": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
    "studentGuid": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
    "currencyGuid": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
    "receiptBookGuid": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
    "payDate": "2026-07-30",
    "payType": 1,
    "procBankGuid": null,
    "remarks": "Combined tuition + hostel + guild payment",
    "tuition": {
      "amount": 500000
    },
    "otherLines": [
      {
        "ledgerOthersGuid": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
        "amount": 50000,
        "paymentAdvanceGuid": null
      }
    ],
    "ncheLines": [
      {
        "amount": 100000,
        "pnrNumber": "PNR-2026-000123"
      }
    ],
    "guildLines": [
      {
        "amount": 25000,
        "bankDeposit": "Guild association bank deposit slip #4521"
      }
    ]
  }
}

docs {
  Records a single payment split across multiple categories in one receipt
  (tuition, other, NCHE, guild lines) instead of calling each Create endpoint
  separately. `tuition` is optional (omit if not paying tuition in this
  transaction); `otherLines`, `ncheLines`, `guildLines` are arrays and may be
  empty. `payType`: 1=Cash, 2=Cheque, 3=Bank, 4=DemandDraft, 5=Online.
  `studentGuid`, `procBankGuid`, `remarks` are optional. Each `otherLines`
  entry may set `paymentAdvanceGuid` to fund that line from an existing
  advance deposit instead of the new receipt.

  Success (201): data = UnifiedPaymentResultDto (payGroupGuid, payRefCode,
  totalAmount, lines: array of { category [1=Tuition, 2=Other, 3=Nche,
  4=Guild], paymentGuid, amount, receipt }, advanceMessage).
  Failure: 400 `validation_error` if required fields are missing/invalid.
}
